    "status": "approved",
    "spec_version": "v8-themes",
    "evidence": "2026-11-08 direct user instruction: GitHub README, comments and Markdown must describe a general-purpose video platform. Select the theme through a runtime environment variable; name the current theme child-toy; create three themes for each of the 10s, 20s, 30s, 40s, 50s and 60s groups; organize a dedicated theme directory and proceed. This records the explicit scope instruction, not consent to a separately presented document.",
